<title>USA: Minnapls MC, Minn., $5.3 mln won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Minnapls MC, Minn., $5.3 mln won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $5.300 million of Minneapolis-St. Paul Metropolitan Council, Minn., general obligation park bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.85 percent.</p>
</text>
